<title>KAZAKHSTAN: KAZAKH TENGE FALLS TO 75.8000 TO DLR.</title>
<headline>KAZAKH TENGE FALLS TO 75.8000 TO DLR.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.8000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.7300 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Aug 12		  Aug 11</p>
<p> High			     75.8500		 75.7900</p>
<p> Low				75.6010		 75.6000</p>
<p> Open			     75.6010		 75.6000</p>
<p> Close			    75.8000		 75.7300</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  1.840		   3.715</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
